{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍对当初忍下那些气感到不服，也因为如今已经不在那些人身边而难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不服、委屈、愤怒、悲伤、失落\",\n      \"missed\": \"“夜色里并肩低语”“旧日记忆又有温度”“想维护自己”等具体关系和记忆线索，以及右上角“离开后才发现心里空了”“越想念越被现实刺痛”两条小字，需要再看才能抓全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他跟自己争得筋疲力尽，不服气逐渐淡了，但想到自己已经不在那些人身边，还是觉得难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"疲惫、失落、难受、眷恋\",\n      \"missed\": \"“脚下地板忽然不见”比较容易单独扫到，但粉色区域里关于旧日相处、回忆和自我维护的具体内容，以及右上角两条提示，仍需要逐条读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他并不是真的想通了，而是已经累得没有力气继续争，离开那些人后仍然感到难受。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"疲惫、失落、悲伤、躁动不安、无力\",\n      \"missed\": \"“一声深深的叹息”“躁动不安加深”“抵抗得累了”等补充感受不一定能一次全部抓到；五条蓝色短语需要分别扫过才能看全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两段大字长句都包含好几层意思，下面又分别出现多条短语。人物的核心状态“不服气、逐渐疲惫、离开后难受”是能抓到的，情绪也基本挂在他的处境上，但具体的旧日相处、回忆、失落和身体感受，需要把两组短语与主句逐一对应才能串完整。尤其第三张增加五条蓝色短语后，补充信息变多，容易变成逐条扫词。底部音符动画主要是抽象的线条和圆点，没有提供明确的人物处境画面。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a762e7fd-391c-4e37-a7c5-a542105a8b43", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T004157084167Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:42:55.363449+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e6432a2143019a6ec0ded6eb66cad2d56429c81bda3ff87911a19f208de6f8cd", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T004157084167Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "fd13d2d1998b682163ee0747373d934d01dc50a2a0ea9b6ff39efd8d59555788"}}}
